îte est abîmée, comme visible sur les photos, mais les chaussures sont neuves et en parfait état.</p><p>Idéales pour l’école, le sport ou une utilisation quotidienne.</p><p>Envoi rapide et soigné 📦</p>","imageUrls":["https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_0.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_1.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_2.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_3.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_4.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_5.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_6.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_7.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_8.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehosted/1789154790045006/1791206708916_9.jpg","https://tojihnuawsoohlolangc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/2f8b09d2-8832-45fc-ba26-ab3dd6e9b2fa/rehos